#: api/v1/devices.py:276
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Assigns or updates a specific UserProperty across multiple devices "
"simultaneously.\n"
"\n"
"    Accepts partial hashes, short IDs, or exact aliases. Ambiguous "
"identifiers are rejected.\n"
"\n"
"    Returns:\n"
"    - 200: Property successfully applied to all devices\n"
"    - 207: Partial success (some identifiers were invalid/ambiguous)\n"
"    - 422: No valid devices provided\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Assigna o actualitza una UserProperty concreta a diversos dispositius "
"alhora.\n"
"\n"
"    Accepta hashos parcials, ID curts o àlies exactes. Es rebutgen els "
"identificadors ambigus.\n"
"\n"
"    Retorna:\n"
"    - 200: propietat aplicada a tots els dispositius\n"
"    - 207: èxit parcial (alguns identificadors no eren vàlids o eren "
"ambigus)\n"
"    - 422: no s'ha indicat cap dispositiu vàlid\n"
"    "

