#: api/v1/lots.py:102
msgid "Assign devices to lot"
msgstr "Assigna dispositius a un lot"

#: api/v1/lots.py:103
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Add multiple devices to a specified lot in a single operation.\n"
"\n"
"    The lot can be identified by either:\n"
"    - Its numeric ID (e.g., #1)\n"
"    - Its name (e.g., \"donante-orgA\")\n"
"\n"
"    Returns:\n"
"    - 200: All valid devices assigned\n"
"    - 207: Partial assignment (some invalid IDs)\n"
"    - 401: Lot is archived\n"
"    - 404: Lot wasnot found\n"
"    - 422: No valid device IDs provided\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Afegeix diversos dispositius a un lot en una sola operació.\n"
"\n"
"    El lot es pot identificar per:\n"
"    - El seu ID numèric (p. ex., #1)\n"
"    - El seu nom (p. ex., \"donante-orgA\")\n"
"\n"
"    Retorna:\n"
"    - 200: tots els dispositius vàlids assignats\n"
"    - 207: assignació parcial (alguns ID no són vàlids)\n"
"    - 401: el lot està arxivat\n"
"    - 404: no s'ha trobat el lot\n"
"    - 422: no s'ha indicat cap ID de dispositiu vàlid\n"
"    "

#: api/v1/lots.py:147
msgid "Remove devices from lot"
msgstr "Treu dispositius d'un lot"

#: api/v1/lots.py:148
msgid ""
"\n"
"    Remove multiple devices from a specified lot in a single operation.\n"
"\n"
"    The lot can be identified by either:\n"
"    - Its numeric ID (e.g., #1)\n"
"    - Its name (e.g., \"donante-orgA\")\n"
"\n"
"    Returns:\n"
"    - 200: All valid devices removed\n"
"    - 207: Partial removal (some invalid IDs)\n"
"    - 422: No valid device IDs provided\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Treu diversos dispositius d'un lot en una sola operació.\n"
"\n"
"    El lot es pot identificar per:\n"
"    - El seu ID numèric (p. ex., #1)\n"
"    - El seu nom (p. ex., \"donante-orgA\")\n"
"\n"
"    Retorna:\n"
"    - 200: tots els dispositius vàlids trets\n"
"    - 207: eliminació parcial (alguns ID no són vàlids)\n"
"    - 422: no s'ha indicat cap ID de dispositiu vàlid\n"
"    "

#: api/v1/lots.py:32
msgid "Retrieve devices in a lot"
msgstr "Obté els dispositius d'un lot"

#: api/v1/lots.py:33
msgid ""
"Get all devices belonging to a specific lot.\n"
"\n"
"    The lot can be identified by either:\n"
"    - Its numeric ID (e.g., #1)\n"
"    - Its name (e.g., \"donante-orgA\")\n"
"\n"
"    Returns:\n"
"    - 200 - Lot details (ID, name, description, etc.) and list of all "
"devices with their technical specifications\n"
"    - 404 - Lot not found\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"Obté tots els dispositius que pertanyen a un lot.\n"
"\n"
"    El lot es pot identificar per:\n"
"    - El seu ID numèric (p. ex., #1)\n"
"    - El seu nom (p. ex., \"donante-orgA\")\n"
"\n"
"    Retorna:\n"
"    - 200 - Detalls del lot (ID, nom, descripció, etc.) i llista de tots els"
" dispositius amb les seves especificacions tècniques\n"
"    - 404 - No s'ha trobat el lot\n"
"    "

