msgid ""
"Each device's second life takes a share of its manufacturing and transport "
"in proportion to hours of use (APOS, the allocation stated in Roura et al. "
"2026), fixed at handover, plus the refurbisher's transport. The per-owner "
"figures are DeviceHub's derivation, not published results. Devices without a"
" usable first-life reading are counted as new."
